# Comet, Stellar Pup: "3 - [-1], then return a card with mana value 2 or less from your graveyard to your hand." The [Dice] fix
# the rolls: 6 ([+1] and two more activations), then 3, then 3.
#
# Bot1's graveyard holds a Lightning Bolt (mana value 1, cast on turn 1) and a Wrath of God (mana value 4, discarded to Bot2's
# Duress on turn 2). The first 3 offers only the Bolt, and Bot1 returns it; the second finds only the Wrath, which is too
# expensive, so nothing is asked and nothing returns. Loyalty 5 + 1 - 1 - 1 = 4.

